{"tuid":"a64jwvfed5vdsrcq","pageVersion":25,"fetchedAt":"2026-09-30T09:55:56.751Z","record":{"colophon":{"generator":"ifdb.org/viewgame","generatorversion":1,"originated":"2026-05-01"},"identification":{"ifids":["ZCODE-3-100213-DC18","ZCODE-1-070929-D35A","ZCODE-4-100329-DC17"],"bafn":3040,"format":"zcode"},"bibliographic":{"title":"Across The Stars: The Ralckor Incident","author":"Dark Star and Peter Mattsson","language":"en","firstpublished":"2007-09-30","genre":"Science Fiction","description":"In the year 5367 IR, humanity is well established throughout the galaxy. It has been over twenty-thousand years since the Zal&#039;tacs passed through our solar system, trading their technology for our food and resources. <br> <br>Lucius Winterson, the Eurmerican ambassador delegated to greet the aliens, was so successful in his mission that he eventually became Earth&#039;s sole representative on the Zal&#039;tac Council. In return, he acquired personal technology that has kept him alive throughout the millennia, creating an Empire in the process, the Xulthe&#039;en Empire. <br> <br>In <i>Across The Stars</i>, you serve the Xulthe&#039;en Empire aboard a deep-space transport. Adjusting to your lifestyle hasn&#039;t been easy though, your berth is small and cramped and the twelve-and-a-half-hour shifts are long. The Captain even gave you an extra week of duty for not having your uniform property squared away. In a place this small, you&#039;re beginning to wonder if you have what it takes to serve the Empire.  <br> <br>Set off on a new adventure, as you travel Across The Stars."},"contacts":{"url":"https://acrossthestars.infodarkness.com/"},"ifdb":{"tuid":"a64jwvfed5vdsrcq","pageversion":25,"link":"https://ifdb.org/viewgame?id=a64jwvfed5vdsrcq","coverart":{"url":"https://ifdb.org/coverart?id=a64jwvfed5vdsrcq&version=25"},"primaryPlayOnlineUrl":"https://iplayif.com/?story=https%3A%2F%2Funbox.ifarchive.org%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fifarchive.org%252Fif-archive%252Fgames%